    </div>

    <div class="doors">
      <div class="door">
        <h3>Coming along?</h3>
        <p>Free to attend. Tell us you&rsquo;re coming, who you&rsquo;re bringing, and what you&rsquo;re making room for.</p>

        <a class="rsvp" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfqP2VO002_GZStXnp9bfTKgvmA6uT2-KaAvSIPTcn0QmbAOA/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
