        <p class="door__alt">Or email <a href="mailto:rsvp@makeroomexp.org">rsvp@makeroomexp.org</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="door" id="involved">
        <h3>Or help us build it.</h3>
        <ul class="ways">
          <li><b>Volunteer</b><span>Setup, day or evening shift. Roughly three to five hours.</span></li>
          <li><b>Artist / maker</b><span>Show work, run a table, or make something in the room.</span></li>
          <li><b>Vendor</b><span>Bring product for the day.</span></li>
          <li><b>In-kind</b><span>Furniture, clothing for the swap, bar supplies, food trucks.</span></li>
          <li><b>Breathwork</b><span>Open the day with a guided session.</span></li>
          <li><b>Photo / video</b><span>Document the day from more angles.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p>In-kind donations are received through Majestic Art Gallery, a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit, and may be tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p>

        <a class="rsvp rsvp--ghost" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfJFTeMTCuegl9182EnXL3MCN96qcWpJuODHzOF-CJeKMtl-g/viewform"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener">
